  "mechanism": "EpollFile::pop_multi_ready removes a ready EPOLLET entry (Entry::poll returns is_still_ready=false) before do_epoll_pwait2 copies events to user memory. A write_val EFAULT returns with no rollback, and nothing requeues the entry because no new notification arrives.",
