  "contract": "epoll_wait(2)/epoll(7): an epoll_wait that fails with EFAULT delivers no event, so an edge-triggered event must still be returned by the next valid epoll_wait.",
  "observed": "After epoll_wait returns EFAULT for an unwritable buffer, a valid epoll_wait returns 0 while the EPOLLET eventfd is still unread.",
